# ALLOWLIST GITIGNORE — ignore everything, then un-ignore only what ships.
# This repo lives inside a folder containing call recordings, transcripts, interview
# analysis and compensation notes. Those must never be committed, private repo or not.
# Denylisting is one forgotten entry away from a leak; this is the safe direction.

# 1. Ignore everything
*

# 2. Un-ignore the directories we need to descend into
!*/
# ...but re-ignore the ones that must never ship, including their contents
Meetings/
Transcripts/
Field\ Guides/
archive/
.claude/
Take-home/

# 3. Un-ignore only what ships
!README.md
!LICENSE
!.gitignore
!app/
!app/**

